@baseUrl = https://localhost:5006
@token = replace-with-token

### List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/rosters?from=2027-01-01&to=2027-01-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/rosters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"employeeId":1,"workDate":"2027-01-01","shiftId":1,"operationalLocationProjectionId":1,"source":"Manual","workKind":"Extended","dayClassification":"NormalWorkingDay"}

### Edit draft
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/rosters/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedVersion":1,"data":{"employeeId":1,"workDate":"2027-01-01","shiftId":1,"operationalLocationProjectionId":1,"source":"Manual","workKind":"Extended","dayClassification":"NormalWorkingDay"}}

### Bulk draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/rosters/bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"rows":[{"employeeId":1,"workDate":"2027-01-02","shiftId":1,"operationalLocationProjectionId":1}]}

### Publish
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/rosters/1/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedVersion":2}

### Cancel future
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/rosters/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedVersion":3}

### Published employee day evidence (drafts excluded)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/rosters/classification?employeeId=1&workDate=2027-01-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
